          {
            "text": "赶忙 narrates a hurried response to circumstances. It differs from describing an ordinary routine.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他赶忙开门。",
                "pinyin": "tā gǎnmáng kāi mén 。",
                "meaning": "He hurriedly opened the door.",
                "audio": "664b7c3db8d81c3b2a07839edd4beb8560ce14a452283cde5887e147e3548343"
              },
              {
                "text": "我赶忙给他打电话。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ gǎnmáng gěi tā dǎdiànhuà 。",
                "meaning": "I hurriedly called him.",
